","type":"text"},{"text":"gets the warning beat before the dice can turn on them again.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To make the dark harmless for a stretch — a room whose solution is to stand","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in it on purpose, a scene that should not be interrupted — set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not stop the daemon by name.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(\"grue\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"freezes the counter at whatever it had reached, so resuming can land the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"player straight on a dice turn and cost them the warning; suspending resets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the count for exactly that reason.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon is named "},{"code":"\"grue\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Timer names are global, but two instances"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of "},{"code":"DangerousDark","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in one game already collide on their shared "},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"namespace before the timer name matters — one lethal dark per game."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark"]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/GameContent-Implementations":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/gamecontent-implementations","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","title":"GameContent 